    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39181" root="نبج" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَجَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبُجَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِيجٌ</span>, <i>He uttered a loud,</i>
or <i>vehement voice,</i> or <i>cry.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَجَ</span>, inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبْجٌ</span>, <i>Pepedit, certo modo:</i> (TA:) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُبَاجٌ</span>,
<i>crepitum ventris emisit; pepedit.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَجَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَاجٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِيجٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a dog) <i>barked;
i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَحَ</span>. (S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَجَ</span> <i>He mixed up,</i> or <i>beat
up,</i> fresh milk, <i>with a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَّاجَة</span>, <i>until it became froth,
in which state it is eaten with dates, taken up with
three fingers.</i> Only the Benoo-Asad did this.
(IKh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَجَ</span> <i>He mixed up</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوِيق</span> &amp;c. (TA.)

